
// Beat names resolve lexically, so a nested sibling is reachable by
// NAME from anywhere in its scope. Scope context flows through captured
// chains: entering Other (a nested beat) captures Main's live scope, so
// resolving Helper from inside Other finds that context again, whether
// through a reference or by name.

beat Main
  new state
    origin: "main"

  beat Helper
    Nested helper from $origin.

  beat Other(target)
    Other starts.
    beat(target)
    beat("Helper")
    Other ends.

  -> Other(Helper)

beat Helper
  Top level helper.

/*
<test>
- expected: |
    ~ Other starts.

    ~ Nested helper from main.

    ~ Nested helper from main.

    ~ Other ends.
</test>
*/
